WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:04.000
Subtitles are rendered as a styled overlay,
not by the browser's own cue painter.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.500
That is what makes four sizes — and the
rest of the settings panel — possible.

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:13.000
Everything here is keyboard reachable,
and announced to a screen reader.
